WEBVTT

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:38.070
Sports News!

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:46.090
The world championships
heads towards the climax!

00:01:46.090 --> 00:01:49.600
The finals were supposed to be between the top two teams of the round robin matches...

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:55.590
But with Neo-Borg at 4-1 and both
BBA Revolution and F-Sangre at 3-2,

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:58.570
three teams have
made it all this way!

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:03.560
Will there be another round robin match between all three teams?

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:07.010
Or will it be a
straight final round?

00:02:07.010 --> 00:02:11.670
We're waiting for an announcement from each team at BBA HQ!

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:12.250
It's quite a--

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:15.190
We'll report on it
as soon as we know!

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:17.820
And one more
piece of big news!

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:21.510
In addition
to the finals,

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:25.200
we have a special match
between the other teams!

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:27.170
Don't miss it!

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:32.690
Time for the finals!

00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:34.860
A final round with
all three teams...

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:37.420
I wonder what
the matchups will be?

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:40.540
No matter what it's like,
we just have to do our best!

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:41.700
Right, Daichi?

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:44.100
Yeah! We're gonna win!

00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:58.670
Feels like I haven't
been home in ages.

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:01.490
Home sweet home!

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:03.750
This isn't your home!

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:06.660
It might as well be now!

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:18.410
I wonder if Takao grew up a
little while he was overseas.

00:03:18.410 --> 00:03:21.220
Whaddaya mean
it might as well be?!

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:22.530
It's fine, isn't it?

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:25.200
Outta the way, Daichi!

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:27.540
No, I'm going in first!

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:30.300
I like being
first at everything!

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:34.510
Fighting as soon
as you get home?

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:35.360
Grandpa!

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:36.740
I'm home!

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:38.190
Hey now...

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:42.790
I wish Hitoshi
could've stopped by.

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:45.380
He said he had a
meeting at BBA HQ.

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:48.000
Japanese food is the best!

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:51.080
Being at home calms the soul!

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:54.380
Again with that?
That's my line!

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:55.550
Finders keepers!

00:03:56.010 --> 00:03:57.250
That was mine!

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:59.460
Survival of the fittest!

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:02.190
You won't be champ for
long with reflexes that slow!

00:04:05.450 --> 00:04:07.940
Right back at you!

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:08.850
Screw you!

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:10.290
You wanna go?

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:17.520
Too bad, Max.

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:20.440
That's kind of depressing...

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:23.950
Too bad this year, Max!

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:25.560
There's always next time.

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:31.950
That's not it, either...

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:34.050
I just want to
hear his voice again...

00:04:34.050 --> 00:04:35.620
I'm home!

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:38.960
It's been so long
since I've been home.

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:45.120
Oh, err, uh, Max, how
do I put it? There's always...

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:46.740
I'm home, daddy!

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:48.620
Welcome back.

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:50.230
Good to be back.

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:02.070
Daddy, I'm fine!

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:03.680
I'm not depressed about it.

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:05.420
Oh, that's a relief.

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:11.220
My battle against
Takao was so exciting.

00:05:11.220 --> 00:05:15.410
It was like time stopped!
I wanted that moment to never end.

00:05:16.220 --> 00:05:19.640
I fought with everything I had,
so I have no regrets.

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:25.510
You're looking a little cooler compared to when you left.

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:27.830
Maybe I am!

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:31.600
--Time to eat!
--Time to eat!

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:39.400
--Mayonnaise goes perfect with udon noodles!
--Mayonnaise goes perfect with udon noodles!

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:02.000
Max, what's with the luggage?

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:07.170
The idea of forming a tag
with you sounds great.

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:10.420
But if I can fight you
on the world stage...

00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:15.920
Then that sounds like an
even better idea, doesn't it?

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:17.480
Max...

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:19.840
Takao, the two of us...

00:06:21.220 --> 00:06:25.120
Want to defeat you and
become world champions.

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:30.100
Sorry, Takao.

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:32.530
I have to go.

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:42.040
We...

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:47.410
Are still friends, right?

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:50.380
Good luck, Takao.

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:53.220
I'll see you in the
world championships.

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:04.050
This is where it all began.

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:09.920
But now it's over.

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:14.630
Rei!

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:15.790
Max...

00:07:16.230 --> 00:07:18.990
You too, Max?

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:20.370
So...!

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:23.010
Yeah. This place is special.

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:26.920
This is where we decided to leave the BBA so we could fight Takao.

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:38.670
A lot happened. The path was
difficult, but I got my chance to fight Takao.

00:07:38.670 --> 00:07:41.440
I formed a team to beat Takao.

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:44.160
It wasn't that simple though.

00:07:45.530 --> 00:07:48.640
But I like my team now.

00:07:48.640 --> 00:07:50.720
Rai's improved a lot, too.

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:53.790
I think so!
The same goes for me.

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:57.090
My team was
all over the place.

00:07:57.090 --> 00:07:59.210
But I was able to
get along with Rick.

00:08:01.030 --> 00:08:04.900
We went through a lot, but now I'm proud of my team.

00:08:04.900 --> 00:08:08.800
That's why I want to challenge
Takao again with my own team,

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:10.860
and share that
victory with them!

00:08:22.340 --> 00:08:28.180
Thanks to this year's world championships, I was able to collect a lot of data on top-class Bladers.

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:30.220
Very valuable data.

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:34.470
Takao, I hope you're looking
forward to your new Dragoon.

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:42.020
They finally quieted down.

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:43.400
Got it?

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:44.370
Got what?

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:46.100
Fighting again?

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:50.480
You better not lose, Daichi.

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:52.270
Same to you...

00:08:52.270 --> 00:08:54.840
Fighting while they sleep...

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:58.640
Daichi, let's do our
best in the finals!

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:01.380
Yeah, we're gonna win!

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:06.410
If you can even
call this fighting...

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:14.470
Mornin', grandpa.

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:19.000
Takao, you can
take the day off.

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:21.520
I just woke up like this.

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:24.870
Grandpa, would you
practice with me?

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:30.660
If I want to become world champion,
I need to work on this stuff, too.

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:32.520
Oh, really?

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:35.910
I guess miracles do happen...

00:09:43.620 --> 00:09:45.840
You've got a
ways to go, Takao!

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:48.220
You've been slacking!

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:54.010
I'll carry all of
your hopes with me!

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:04.490
How perceptive!

00:10:06.230 --> 00:10:10.280
No matter what happens
in the finals, I won't lose.

00:10:10.280 --> 00:10:12.700
I'm always ready to roll!

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:14.320
That, and...

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:15.880
I vow...

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.530
To win!!

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:27.380
Are you okay, grandpa?

00:10:30.220 --> 00:10:33.310
Your travels have
matured you a little.

00:10:33.310 --> 00:10:35.860
Let's get breakfast, grandpa!

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:38.590
Daichi will probably be
hungry when he gets back.

00:10:38.850 --> 00:10:42.260
I'm sure he's just
as excited as I am.

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:47.650
I'm the best!
I swear I'm gonna win!

00:10:47.650 --> 00:10:50.400
So let's get this
thing started already!

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:57.970
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:02.930
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:04.660
Number one!

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:08.030
Number one! Number one! Number one!

00:11:08.030 --> 00:11:10.440
Number one! Number one!

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:13.230
Too bad! I'm number one!

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:14.840
And you're number two!

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:19.380
Rats! Get back here!
I'm number one!

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:22.000
The finals are about to start.

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:25.050
But how are three
teams going to fight?

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:27.860
Maybe it'll be a
round-robin format again.

00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:29.870
Or maybe all three teams
will battle at the same time?

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:31.820
Can't we just do
rock-paper-scissors?

00:11:31.820 --> 00:11:33.670
No way!

00:11:36.330 --> 00:11:38.880
I wonder what
the finals'll be like?

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:41.520
I can't wait to battle!

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:44.100
I hate not knowing
what'll happen!

00:11:44.100 --> 00:11:44.120
Hurry it up!!
I hate not knowing
what'll happen!

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:45.930
Hurry it up!!

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:49.490
It's not my decision!

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:56.340
But I know how you feel, Daichi.

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:57.680
Right?!

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:04.030
In my mind, I already know
who I'm gonna fight.

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:05.290
You too?

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:06.330
You too?

00:12:06.550 --> 00:12:09.500
I'm just itching
to fight them!

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:11.090
For sure.

00:12:12.510 --> 00:12:15.880
We gotta fight them again.

00:12:16.780 --> 00:12:20.980
Is that an acceptable
matchup for the finals?

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:23.080
I have no complaints.

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:24.520
You got it!

00:12:24.520 --> 00:12:25.710
Very well.

00:12:31.860 --> 00:12:33.850
Sports News!

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:41.010
The matchups for the three teams in the finals has just been decided!

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:48.170
The BBA Revolution and F-Sangre will battle it out, since they're both at three wins and two losses!

00:12:48.170 --> 00:12:54.010
And the winner will be up against Neo-
Borg, who has four wins and one loss!

00:12:54.270 --> 00:12:59.120
The details will be announced at this upcoming press conference!

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:03.920
A rematch against F-Sangre,
the team we lost to before...

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:08.850
Takao buckled under the pressure of being
the champion and lost sight of his real battle.

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:10.850
And lost the match.

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:16.440
Takao is fine now...

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:20.650
Having lost to them before is a black mark on their mindset.

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:26.210
We thought that F-Sangre
specialized in four-man battles,

00:13:26.210 --> 00:13:29.200
but they showed great
strength solo, as well.

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:43.000
You could even say they're the team on the
biggest roll in the world championships.

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:56.230
Will Takao be okay?

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:03.710
The BBA has already
lost to us once.

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:06.580
They'll be
careful in the finals.

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:11.300
They probably won't accept a four-man battle,
since that's where we have the advantage.

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:12.740
But...

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:16.860
That's not all we can do.

00:14:18.550 --> 00:14:20.320
Right, Raul?

00:14:22.020 --> 00:14:22.800
Yeah!

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:24.440
Indeed.

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:28.050
Que sera sera.
Whatever happens, happens.

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:31.610
Coach, we should head
to the press conference.

00:14:31.610 --> 00:14:34.500
I'd like to make a stop
on the way there.

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:48.400
This is our home?

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:51.360
Our circus troupe!

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:54.340
Never thought you'd see
them in Japan, right?

00:14:54.630 --> 00:14:57.220
This'll be a good
way to relax.

00:14:58.370 --> 00:14:59.820
--Coach!
--Coach!

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:14.480
Julia! Raul!

00:15:14.480 --> 00:15:15.930
--We're back!
--We're back!

00:15:19.550 --> 00:15:20.760
Did we surprise you?

00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:23.390
I'm glad to be
surprised like this!

00:15:23.390 --> 00:15:25.360
We've been
watching you play!

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:28.590
Everyone was just talking about how nice it'd be to see you!

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:31.360
We can't come cheer you
on, but do your best!

00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:32.940
--All of you!
--All of you!

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:37.210
Wow! You made
it to the finals!

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:41.000
Julia! Raul! You gotta teach
me how to Beyblade!

00:15:41.300 --> 00:15:46.850
I can't believe that crybaby Raul is
fighting against world-class Bladers.

00:15:46.850 --> 00:15:48.210
Jeez...

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:51.570
You've got to win
after coming so far!

00:15:51.570 --> 00:15:53.960
We'll be making
arrangements for the party!

00:15:53.960 --> 00:15:56.920
Hey now, don't put that
sort of pressure on them.

00:15:56.920 --> 00:15:58.040
No.

00:16:01.340 --> 00:16:04.240
I'm not pressured. I'm glad!

00:16:06.890 --> 00:16:11.150
For us, a stage is where we show ourselves at our best.

00:16:15.380 --> 00:16:20.120
If we show them something
great, the audience will clap for us.

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:26.420
Letting yourself get absorbed in that
wave of applause is the greatest feeling!

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:33.380
Beyblading is no different.

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:36.260
If we show them a
great battle in the stadium...

00:16:36.260 --> 00:16:40.120
The audience will give
us more applause!

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:45.090
If we want the ultimate
applause on the ultimate stage...

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:48.990
We have to beat the BBA!

00:16:51.700 --> 00:16:53.410
They've really grown.

00:16:53.410 --> 00:16:56.290
Not that I had
any hand in that.

00:16:59.110 --> 00:17:03.260
Julia, Raul.
You two really have grown.

00:17:03.260 --> 00:17:05.140
--Oh, no...
--Oh, no...

00:17:05.630 --> 00:17:11.140
Both of you came here with no talent,
and now the whole world is watching you!

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:13.220
You've really
worked so hard.

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:17.730
We're all
so proud of you!

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:19.420
Leader...

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:25.440
You can't cry yet, Raul.

00:17:25.740 --> 00:17:28.540
Yeah.
We can cry after we win.

00:17:28.540 --> 00:17:30.320
You're right.

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:35.510
Raul's back to
being a crybaby.

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:43.860
We will now hold
a press conference...

00:17:43.860 --> 00:17:47.510
Regarding the final round of the
Beyblade world championships.

00:17:47.510 --> 00:17:56.870
I would like for the BBA Revolution and
F-Sangre to make a comment ahead of their match.

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:07.820
I know this is sudden, but the BBA would like to challenge F-Sangre to a four-man battle.

00:18:09.450 --> 00:18:10.770
Takao!

00:18:11.240 --> 00:18:12.630
Are you sure?

00:18:13.830 --> 00:18:15.730
--A four-man battle.

00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:18.960
We wanna fight
you at your best!

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:23.870
So let us battle you in
your specialty! A four-man battle!

00:18:24.100 --> 00:18:27.050
But you won't
beat us this time!

00:18:32.610 --> 00:18:34.270
Sorry for the wait.

00:18:34.270 --> 00:18:37.130
Dragoon Galaxy Turbo is complete.

00:18:39.100 --> 00:18:43.100
Using Dragoon Galaxy as a base, I input
all the data from the round robin battles.

00:18:43.480 --> 00:18:48.070
Dragoon Galaxy Turbo has its
performance increased across the board.

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:53.700
Its primary feature is that the
tip can now be swapped out.

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:57.460
Previously, Dragoon only
had an Engine Gear,

00:18:57.460 --> 00:19:03.000
but now you can choose the tip to adapt
to your opponent's style or the stadium.

00:19:03.860 --> 00:19:08.310
There's nothing that can stand up to the ultimate evolution this Beyblade has gone through.

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:10.340
Thanks, Kyoujyu!

00:19:10.340 --> 00:19:13.260
Let's fight a good fight,
Dragoon Galaxy Turbo.

00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:21.270
Let's see that determination!

00:19:21.270 --> 00:19:24.610
--Three! Two! One!
--Three! Two! One!

00:19:24.610 --> 00:19:26.570
--Go, Shoot!
--Go, Shoot!

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:38.260
Not on my watch!

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:41.270
They're fast!
In that case...

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:51.080
Julia! Raul!
We're gonna win this time!

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:55.070
You can't beat F-Sangre with
shallow feelings like that!

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:57.660
Here it comes!

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:08.010
They caught it!

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:11.650
This is our determination!

00:20:11.650 --> 00:20:14.720
If we can't beat them, I'll
never let myself live it down!

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:17.610
Yeah! My blood's boiling!

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:23.480
It's time for payback!

00:20:26.140 --> 00:20:27.020
What?!

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:33.240
--All right!

00:20:33.240 --> 00:20:36.790
They don't seem
pressured this time!

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:40.140
I was overthinking it.

00:20:40.140 --> 00:20:44.580
Takao. Daichi. I approve
of your determination.

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:54.100
We wanna fight
you at your best!

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:59.030
So let us battle you in
your specialty! A four-man battle!

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:02.520
But you won't
beat us this time!

00:21:04.470 --> 00:21:06.230
A four-man battle...

00:21:06.230 --> 00:21:10.310
Raul, did you really
want to fight them alone?

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:14.580
Not at all. I want to
receive applause with you, sis.

00:21:15.930 --> 00:21:20.720
If we want the ultimate applause
on the ultimate stage in the finals...

00:21:20.720 --> 00:21:23.230
We have to
beat them again.

00:21:25.480 --> 00:21:27.370
A four-man battle...

00:21:28.230 --> 00:21:31.220
Let's do it,
Dragoon Galaxy Turbo.

00:22:55.760 --> 00:22:58.610
F-Sangre! You guys are the
perfect opponents for us!

00:22:58.610 --> 00:23:01.140
Time to see who's the
best at four-man battles!

00:23:01.140 --> 00:23:04.630
But they sure are tough...
This isn't gonna be easy, Takao!

00:23:04.630 --> 00:23:07.080
Now it's sink or swim!

00:23:07.080 --> 00:23:08.380
Listen to this, Daichi!

00:23:08.730 --> 00:23:10.350
What?! Really?!

00:23:10.350 --> 00:23:11.740
Can we really do that?

00:23:11.740 --> 00:23:15.480
Beats me! But if we nail it,
it'd be really cool!

00:23:15.480 --> 00:23:18.370
You're right!
Let's do it, Takao!

00:23:18.370 --> 00:23:21.550
Let's go, Daichi!
We're gonna finish this!
